# Lil Timmy's White Kitten in Stormwind.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor); Forever client 1.60.1.70338 via
# wago.tools (ItemSparse prices; every pet item teaches its companion when
# used). A White Kitten vendor near the Stonetalon / Mulgore border has also
# been reported (unconfirmed).

step Lil Timmy
  tip Lil Timmy sells the White Kitten (60s). He walks around the city, so the waypoint is only one point on his path; look along the nearby streets if he is not there. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 8666                         -- Lil Timmy
  buy 8489 npc 8666 optional          -- Cat Carrier (White Kitten), 60s
